license: GPL-3.0-or-later
keywords:
  - coding-agents
  - code-quality
  - prompt-engineering
  - benchmark
  - slop-code-bench
abstract: >-
  Prompts and measurements for getting coding agents to write better code,
  scored against SlopCodeBench. Holds the prompt experiments, the run ledgers
  for each problem, and the quality numbers split between implementation and
  test code.
